 to all the given constraints. I\'ll check for any missing colons, incorrect indents, or misused variables.\n\nOnce everything looks good, I\'ll present the playbook as the final answer.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Create directories\n  file:\n    path: "{{ item }}"\n    state: directory\n    mode: \'0755\'\n  loop: "{{ httpd_directories }}"\n  loop_var: directory\n\n- name: Configure directories\n  template:\n    src: directory.conf.j2\n    dest: "{{ httpd_config_directory }}/{{ item }}.conf"\n    mode: \'0644\'\n  loop: "{{ httpd_directories | map(\'file_name\') }}"\n  loop_var: directory_name\n  notify:\n    - Test httpd configuration validity\n    - Restart httpd\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-20T22:43:16.755048697Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 10532610238, 'load_duration': 94674712, 'prompt_eval_count': 390, 'prompt_eval_duration': 100232687, 'eval_count': 612, 'eval_duration': 10336557217, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--8124f6d2-700e-4d42-b689-cdfba6a2118e-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 390, 'output_tokens': 612, 'total_tokens': 1002}
